{"id":"n54138-2-7","stage":5,"title":"뜯어보다 · 拆开看","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54138-2-7-1","ko":"해외에 있는 친구가 내게 소포를 보내왔어.","zh":"我住在国外的朋友给我寄了包裹。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"해외에","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외에","audio":"/audio/84135f01d628793ff842.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"내게","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내게","audio":"/audio/ced087689b947fbe376c.mp3"}},{"text":"소포를","meaning":"包裹","explanation":"소포：包裹；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소포","audio":"/audio/2e59de152924fbbdd56c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49257","senseId":"1","lemma":"소포","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소포를","audio":"/audio/e082c3f8d271e00f8dbd.mp3"}},{"text":"보내왔어.","meaning":"送来，寄来","explanation":"보내오다：送来，寄来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보내오다","audio":"/audio/d59a05175535f2d4de27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14504","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내왔어","audio":"/audio/513759882f14dcd20c8c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3","entryId":"62481","definition":"不是自己国家，别的国家。","pronunciation":["해ː외","해ː웨"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"2e59de152924fbbd","term":"소포","zh":"包裹","audio":"/audio/2e59de152924fbbdd56c.mp3","entryId":"49257","definition":"通过邮局发送的、包装好的小行李。","pronunciation":["소ː포"]},{"id":"d59a05175535f2d4","term":"보내오다","zh":"送来，寄来","audio":"/audio/d59a05175535f2d4de27.mp3","entryId":"14504","definition":"使人或事物向着接收人一方移动过来。","pronunciation":["보내오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/31f073ac5b59a5f67967.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54138-2-7-2","ko":"뭐가 들었는지 궁금하다. 얼른 뜯어봐.","zh":"好奇里面装了什么，快拆开看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐가","audio":"/audio/2c57e944c5dd1dbd2cf3.mp3"}},{"text":"들었는지","meaning":"包含，含有","explanation":"들다：包含，含有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"9","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었는지","audio":"/audio/190a64392f684f7887c8.mp3"}},{"text":"궁금하다.","meaning":"好奇，纳闷儿","explanation":"궁금하다：好奇，纳闷儿；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35136","senseId":"1","lemma":"궁금하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地。","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"뜯어봐.","meaning":"拆开看","explanation":"뜯어보다：拆开看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뜯어보다","audio":"/audio/01fa099fe2c6464e4d31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54138","senseId":"2","lemma":"뜯어보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜯어봐","audio":"/audio/e1426062c21fd04a8b21.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"包含，含有","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"装在里面或组成一部分。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"8aa230c6a19b7e60","term":"궁금하다","zh":"好奇，纳闷儿","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3","entryId":"35136","definition":"非常想知道。","pronunciation":["궁금하다"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"01fa099fe2c6464e","term":"뜯어보다","zh":"拆开看","audio":"/audio/01fa099fe2c6464e4d31.mp3","entryId":"54138","definition":"扒开粘着的东西察看里面。","pronunciation":["뜨더보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a75891b2d713b1e6e82c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.264,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54138","label":"国